  title "Immutable artifacts and migration pass staging acceptance"
milestone DEPLOYED:
  title "Exact staged artifacts serve production and independent readback passes"
task release CURRENTLY_VERIFIED -> RELEASE_READY:
  title "統合意識の公開作成切替とリリース準備"
  description "Owner production deployment2026-10-10 authorizes ADR0067 revision2 C7 new public battle selector unified-consciousness-v1/battle binding format v6. Keep historical battle execution. Add HTTP binding/privacy regression; individually review impacted authority, build/typecheck/full governed tests; PR and mandatory exact-source CI under docs/release_process.md. Release candidate v0.24.0-rc.1 reached main a0991e6e with successful CI38040112770, but Stage38040672331 failed because new consciousness operation was absent from the closed provider taxonomy. Correct under existing ADR0067 C5/ADR0051: provider taxonomy v4 registers unified-consciousness-v1 in existing characterExpression, preserving historical v2/v3 and unknown-label refusal/caps. Individually review/seal two accounting/E2E tests and rerun required checks; correction candidate v0.24.0-rc.2. Preserve failed rc.20, rc.1 and rc.2 evidence. Current owner authorizes ADR0069 revision1: policy v2 bounded accounted429 adapter retries and private failed-action feedback; Application v0.24.0-rc.3 main a8235fb5 passed CI38048891072 but Stage38049445564 stopped after3 physical attempts with top-level action fields outside the output envelope. Correct the immutable prompt as unified-consciousness-prompt-v2: complete valid decision-envelope examples limited to supplied legal actions/refs; retain prompt-v1 byte behavior for bound historical battles, no output rewriting or schema retry. Application v0.24.0-rc.4 main71a77dae passed CI38051995760; Stage38052599650 battle finished at9 ticks/42physical attempts but post-completion observer rejected binding6 with PUBLIC_COMPLETION_REQUIRES_AWARENESS_V5. Correct completion observer to verify saved unified runtime/policy/prompt, resolved physical budget and complete role usage; bind v6 narration to successful publication rather than historical single-claim semantics. Candidate application v0.24.0-rc.5. Completion requires regression tests, individual authority reviews and all exact-source CI checks."
  duration 5p
  status planned
task stage RELEASE_READY -> STAGED:
  title "同一成果物をステージングで検証"
  description "Owner2026-10-11 explicitly authorizes repaired execution retry, retaining the bounded corrected Stage scope: one additional battle max38 advances/200physical attempts, no character-create or automatic new battle retry, charge unpriced. Stage application v0.24.0-rc.5 exact immutable artifacts after ADR0069 tests/requiredCI; verify PostgreSQL/auth/R2/SSE and terminal battle plus accounting. Prior rc.1 used1, rc.2 used6 and rc.3 used3 and rc.4 used42 attempts; all failed and cannot promote. Retain the current owner authorization for correction/testing/deployment/staging and account any next Stage as a new bounded run, never an automatic workflow retry. Completion needs new successful Stage and durable readback."
  duration 2p
  status planned
task promote STAGED -> DEPLOYED:
  title "同一成果物を本番昇格し読み戻す"
  description "Owner already authorized production deployment. Dispatch protected Promote release with exact stage identities and typed confirmation; protected environment review may require owner UI action. Read back production revision/Worker version, health/auth/SSE and logs. Completion requires actual serving evidence, not workflow dispatch."
  duration 1p
  status planned

task design NOW -> DESIGNED:
  title "統合意識の詳細契約と影響を具体化"
  description "ADR0067 revision2 D1-D8 and detailed contract C1-C8: memory insert/remove limits, event3tick admission, synchronous parallel A/B judgment, continuation, late/crash/failure semantics, private persistence, new binding6 and historical compatibility, finite policy and comparable fixtures. Completion requires reviewable exact contract and successful ADR/document/both-schedule/next checks, not runtime cutover."
  duration 2p
  status done
task accept DESIGNED -> ACCEPTED:
  title "所有者が詳細契約を受入"
  description "Only explicit owner acceptance of exact ADR revision and operating contract closes this milestone. Task selection does not authorize implementation."
  duration 1p
  status done
task implement ACCEPTED -> IMPLEMENTED:
  title "統合意識と優先順位付き記憶を実装"
  description "Implement accepted new-battle binding, memory operations, single consciousness input/output and scheduling; preserve existing awareness-v5 continuation. Add behavioral regression coverage. No paid calls or deployment."
  duration 5p
  status done
task verify IMPLEMENTED -> VERIFIED:
  title "契約と互換性を検証"
  description "Verify memory ordering/overflow/deletion/atomicity, always-in-input, event retention, late/replay safety, private boundaries and historical continuation. Run shared build then governed tests and typecheck with eligibility checks. Offline results do not prove model quality or savings."
  duration 2p
  status done

task fullVerification VERIFIED -> CURRENTLY_VERIFIED:
  title "根拠不備を解消した公式全体検証"
  description "2026-10-10 owner correction and Accepted ADR0068 revision1 retract earlier whole-suite completion. Preserve previous scoped results. After selector correction in docs/test-authority-fail-closed.pert, review stale test authority individually and run official full suite with no disabled authority. Do not bulk reseal or delete tests. Completion requires actual official exit0, typecheck and updated evidence. Owner explicitly authorized 2026-10-10: checkpoint commit first, then individually review/fix all 28 blocked files, preserve historical evidence, reseal each against reviewed current contracts and record per-file findings. First official recovery run detected 3 newly stale dependents (awareness-execution, battle-speech-wiring, character-agency-inventory) through the reviewed battle-service effort revision; individually confirm and reseal those necessary downstream scopes too, preserving tests and original failure evidence. Selector repair is complete at 8a144c37. Completion requires zero invalid unit authority and actual official full-suite exit0 plus typecheck. Estimate provisional for individual review and recovery."
  duration 5p
  status done

